85
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:45,320
When he comes to see me,

86
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:46,440
he just brings a bag of things,

87
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,280
puts it down,

88
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:48,320
and turns around to leave,

89
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,840
like he's throwing an explosive pack.

90
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:50,560
Be content.

91
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:51,880
Daughters are much better

92
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:53,400
than sons.

93
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,400
I want a son now.

94
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:56,880
Do you still have time?

95
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:57,880
It's too late.

96
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:10,040
Come in.

97
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:12,880
Director.

98
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:13,540
Have a seat.

99
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,320
Let me introduce you.

100
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:18,680
This is

101
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,940
Chairman Shao's wife,

102
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:20,839
Ms. Zhong.

103
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:23,440
This is the youngest senior partner at Honghu,

104
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:23,880
Li Xin.

105
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,040
Hello, Ms. Zhong.

106
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,970
I've heard about the Wangang case.

107
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:30,040
Mr. Wan and Old Shao are old friends.

108
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:31,960
You're young and promising.

109
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,600
You flatter me, Ms. Zhong.

110
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,840
I've looked into Chairman Shao's case.

111
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:35,440
Let's begin.

112
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,400
Wait a moment.

113
