129
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:09,920
That's why I was delayed.

130
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:10,680
I'm sorry.

131
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:11,680
This is...

132
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:13,600
