136
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:20,440
This is Li Xin.

137
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:21,320
He's in charge of this case.

138
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:22,040
Nice to meet you.

139
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:22,640
Nice to meet you.

140
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:23,300
Have a seat.

141
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,400
Then, Ms. Zhong, let's continue discussing the case.

142
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:37,600
There's no need to discuss the case.

143
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,280
I basically understand the situation.

144
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:40,280
Let's save time

145
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:42,400
