168
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,840
Then for the subsequent procedures,

169
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:23,640
I'll need Lawyer Li to assist me.

170
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:30,600
No problem.

171
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:32,360
Goodbye.

172
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:37,159
My God, what a headache.

173
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,120
Is he from Beijing?

174
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:42,120
Monks from afar are better at chanting.

175
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:43,760
For this case,

176
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,280
