182
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,720
The case I'm going to talk about today is very...

183
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,840
Lawyer Li, Lawyer Li.

184
00:07:06,840 --> 00:07:08,170
Did you watch the video?

185
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,080
