193
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:29,600
Handsome.

194
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,400
Handsome.

195
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:34,159
If you need a lawyer, you can come to me anytime.

196
00:07:34,159 --> 00:07:35,840
Hello, if you need a lawyer... No, no.

197
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:37,520
If you need a lawyer, come to me anytime.

198
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:38,159
Hello.

199
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:40,120
If you need a lawyer, you can come to me.

200
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:40,880
