00:19:29,240 --> 00:19:30,360
To put it bluntly,

568
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:32,600
they are ignoring the big picture, right?

569
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:33,360
Besides,

570
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:36,210
a successful private entrepreneur like you,

571
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:37,920
who is also a major taxpayer in Leyang,

572
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:38,480
over the years,

573
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:40,080
has contributed so much to the local area.

574
00:19:40,080 --> 00:19:41,000
If this were in ancient times,

575
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:43,120
you would be a big shot

576
00:19:43,120 --> 00:19:44,680
like Shi Chong and Shen Wansan.

577
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:45,920
I believe in this regard,

578
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:48,580
the court will fully consider it no matter what.

579
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:51,900
Xiao Li is young after all.

580
00:19:52,080 --> 00:19:53,840
I don't have much experience with this kind of case.

581
00:19:53,840 --> 00:19:54,760
But I think

582
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:55,960
for our case,

583
00:19:56,040 --> 00:19:57,160
pleading not guilty

584
00:19:57,160 --> 00:19:58,620
is absolutely no problem.

585
00:19:58,640 --> 00:19:59,440
Attorney Qiu,

586
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:01,370
tell us your specific plan.

587
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:03,940
I've already prepared it.

588
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:10,560
You are the snowstorm for the rest of my life,

589
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:12,040
and the clear sky.

590
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:15,720
You are the warmth and cold of the four seasons.

591
00:20:16,040 --> 00:20:18,080
I will love you for a lifetime.

592
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:20,880
Life after life,

593
00:20:20,960 --> 00:20:22,760
my love will never change.

594
00:20:23,520 --> 00:20:25,520
That's pretty much what it means.

595
00:20:26,840 --> 00:20:28,360
Why are you doing this?

596
00:20:29,280 --> 00:20:30,760
It makes me want to cry.

597
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:33,720
So how is my husband doing now?

598
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:35,520
Has he lost or gained weight?

599
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:37,800
I really don't know.

600
00:20:37,800 --> 00:20:39,040
I didn't know him before.

601
00:20:39,040 --> 00:20:40,480
I only saw him once.

602
00:20:40,720 --> 00:20:42,250
Let's get down to business.

603
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:45,900
When did you join Anding Wealth Management?

604
00:20:46,200 --> 00:20:48,240
About seven or eight months ago.

605
00:20:49,040 --> 00:20:50,200
What should we do?

606
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:53,040
Since we met,

607
00:20:53,840 --> 00:20:56,280
we've never been apart for this long.

608
00:20:56,600 --> 00:20:57,440
If I'm not around,

609
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:58,720
he must have lost weight.

610
00:20:58,720 --> 00:20:59,600
Has he lost weight?

611
00:20:59,600 --> 00:21:01,040
I really don't know.

612
00:21:01,280 --> 00:21:02,440
Let's not talk about him.

613
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:03,600
Let's talk about you.

614
00:21:03,600 --> 00:21:05,530
Isn't your situation more urgent?

615
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:06,080
Right?

616
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:07,960
Well...

617
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:09,840
Did you know at the time

618
00:21:09,840 --> 00:21:12,370
that this job was suspected of being illegal?

619
00:21:12,560 --> 00:21:13,320
Now,

620
00:21:13,360 --> 00:21:14,560
Anding Wealth Management is suspected of

621
00:21:14,560 --> 00:21:16,800
illegally absorbing public deposits.

622
00:21:16,800 --> 00:21:17,880
As the store manager,

623
00:21:17,880 --> 00:21:19,640
you are liable for compensation.

624
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:20,720
If you want to

625
00:21:20,720 --> 00:21:22,280
apply for bail pending trial now,

626
00:21:22,280 --> 00:21:23,280
you need to

627
00:21:23,280 --> 00:21:25,320
return all the income you earned

628
00:21:25,320 --> 00:21:26,560
during your employment.

629
00:21:26,560 --> 00:21:28,240
Does my husband know?

630
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:30,920
Do I have to return all this money?

631
00:21:31,080 --> 00:21:32,680
Yu Huihui, here's the thing.

632
00:21:32,920 --> 00:21:33,760
Your husband

633
00:21:33,760 --> 00:21:34,920
has fully entrusted

634
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:36,280
this case to me.

635
00:21:36,600 --> 00:21:37,320
I hope you

636
00:21:37,320 --> 00:21:39,320
will tell me everything you know

637
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:40,280
about this case,

638
00:21:40,280 --> 00:21:41,080
holding nothing back.

639
00:21:41,080 --> 00:21:42,410
Only then can I help you.

640
00:21:42,680 --> 00:21:43,410
Understand?

641
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:45,000
Speak.

642
00:21:46,360 --> 00:21:47,760
There's 1.2 million.

643
00:21:48,320 --> 00:21:49,520
1.2 million?

644
00:21:50,040 --> 00:21:51,100
What money is this?

645
00:21:51,720 --> 00:21:53,320
Is your income that high?

646
00:21:53,480 --> 00:21:55,320
Of course it's not income.

647
00:21:55,600 --> 00:21:58,360
It's the last big investment I collected from a member,

648
00:21:58,360 --> 00:22:00,520
and I haven't had time to transfer it to the company yet.

649
00:22:00,520 --> 00:22:02,280
Didn't the boss run away?

650
00:22:03,040 --> 00:22:04,570
The account is also frozen.

651
00:22:04,600 --> 00:22:05,280
Yu Huihui,

652
00:22:05,640 --> 00:22:07,480
you have to return this money immediately.

653
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:09,810
The amount involved exceeds one million,

654
00:22:10,160 --> 00:22:12,000
which is considered extremely huge.

655
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:12,800
If you don't return it,

656
00:22:12,800 --> 00:22:14,400
you're looking at a minimum of five years in prison.

657
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:15,800
Does my husband know?

658
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,400
What did he say?

659
00:22:17,600 --> 00:22:18,800
You are the client.

660
00:22:18,800 --> 00:22:20,640
Stop asking about your husband.

661
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:22,120
What do you think?

662
00:22:22,120 --> 00:22:23,480
Then where is the money?

663
00:22:31,840 --> 00:22:32,680
Lawyer Xiao.

664
00:22:33,280 --> 00:22:34,280
Stop asking.

665
00:22:34,800 --> 00:22:36,720
My heart is pounding.

666
00:22:38,200 --> 00:22:39,480
I'm so confused.

667
00:22:45,920 --> 00:22:46,650
Lawyer Xiao.

668
00:22:48,960 --> 00:22:49,520
Is my wife doing okay?

669
00:22:49,520 --> 00:22:51,080
Did you read the letter to her?

670
00:22:51,080 --> 00:22:51,800
I did.

671
00:22:51,880 --> 00:22:53,560
She's doing fine.

672
00:22:54,400 --> 00:22:56,600
I noticed she listens to everything you say.

673
00:22:56,600 --> 00:22:58,720
So you know about the 1.2 million.

674
00:23:00,440 --> 00:23:02,770
I was too embarrassed to mention it to you.

675
00:23:02,840 --> 00:23:04,640
I didn't know how to ask you to tell Huihui.

676
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:05,480
What happened?

677
00:23:05,480 --> 00:23:06,200
That money

678
00:23:06,640 --> 00:23:07,240
is now

679
00:23:07,640 --> 00:23:08,760
no longer in our hands.

680
00:23:08,760 --> 00:23:10,560
Huihui's aunt has terminal liver cancer.

681
00:23:10,560 --> 00:23:12,200
Treatment and a transplant cost over a million.

682
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:14,320
I know very well that this money shouldn't be touched,

683
00:23:14,320 --> 00:23:15,360
but saving a life is more important.

684
00:23:15,360 --> 00:23:17,160
I had to lend the money out first.

685
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:18,640
Then, for such an important matter,

686
00:23:18,640 --> 00:23:19,970
Yu Huihui doesn't know?

687
00:23:20,320 --> 00:23:22,120
Huihui is very close to her aunt.

688
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:23,280
I was afraid that if she knew,

689
00:23:23,280 --> 00:23:25,340
she would have a harder time in there.

690
00:23:27,280 --> 00:23:27,880
Zhou Huan,

691
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:30,000
let me make this clear to you.

692
00:23:30,240 --> 00:23:32,440
Yu Huihui misappropriated that money.

693
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:35,200
Now it's not just illegal fundraising.

694
00:23:35,320 --> 00:23:37,760
She is suspected of misappropriating company funds.

695
00:23:37,760 --> 00:23:39,640
When the procuratorate indicts her,

696
00:23:39,640 --> 00:23:41,100
she will face two charges.

697
00:23:41,320 --> 00:23:42,320
The most important thing now

698
00:23:42,320 --> 00:23:44,000
is to pay back the 1.2 million.

699
00:23:44,360 --> 00:23:47,020
Only then can we help her get a lighter sentence.

700
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:47,890
Don't worry.

701
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:49,600
I will definitely find a way to return the money.

702
00:23:49,600 --> 00:23:50,480
As long as I can save Huihui,

703
00:23:50,480 --> 00:23:51,480
even if I have to sell everything I own,

704
00:23:51,480 --> 00:23:52,680
even if I go bankrupt,

705
00:23:52,680 --> 00:23:54,940
even if I have to sell myself, I will do it.

706
00:23:55,400 --> 00:23:56,240
Anyway,

707
00:23:56,240 --> 00:23:58,500
the maximum detention period is 37 days.

708
00:23:58,760 --> 00:24:00,280
There are about ten days left.

709
00:24:00,280 --> 00:24:02,200
Once the formal arrest is approved,

710
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:05,130
it will be difficult to apply for bail pending trial.

711
00:24:05,800 --> 00:24:06,160
Okay.

712
00:24:06,720 --> 00:24:07,280
I'll figure something out.

713
00:24:07,280 --> 00:24:09,140
I'll go raise the money right now.

714
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:13,800
I'll have to trouble Lawyer Li to assist me.

715
00:24:14,960 --> 00:24:15,620
Lawyer Qiu,

716
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:17,880
do you think

717
00:24:18,120 --> 00:24:19,680
we can plead not guilty in this case,

718
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:21,000
or do you think any case that comes to you

719
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:22,460
can be pleaded not guilty?

720
00:24:24,960 --> 00:24:26,080
Go back and follow the timeline

721
00:24:26,080 --> 00:24:27,920
to organize the evidence materials for me.

722
00:24:27,920 --> 00:24:29,650
Hurry up. I'm waiting to see it.

723
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:32,640
Okay. Don't worry.

724
00:24:41,240 --> 00:24:43,160
That little silk scarf is quite stylish.

725
00:24:43,160 --> 00:24:45,080
Since when did our great Lawyer Li

726
00:24:45,360 --> 00:24:46,680
ever assist anyone?

727
00:24:46,840 --> 00:24:47,640
That's really

728
00:24:47,720 --> 00:24:48,640
a joke.

729
00:24:51,480 --> 00:24:52,160
Let's go. Let's go together.

730
00:24:52,160 --> 00:24:52,960
I drove.

731
00:24:53,280 --> 00:24:54,720
Who doesn't have a car?

732
00:25:03,480 --> 00:25:05,000
I find you quite amusing.

733
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:06,320
Is it because after retiring,

734
00:25:06,320 --> 00:25:07,760
you feel empty inside

735
00:25:08,000 --> 00:25:09,240
and can't stay at home?

736
00:25:09,240 --> 00:25:10,400
If I hadn't retired

737
00:25:10,720 --> 00:25:11,800
and didn't need to avoid suspicion,

738
00:25:11,800 --> 00:25:13,600
if you wanted to hang out with me,

739
00:25:14,080 --> 00:25:15,400
you wouldn't even have the chance.

740
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:16,080
My god.

741
00:25:16,080 --> 00:25:17,680
What kind of big shot are you?

742
00:25:18,320 --> 00:25:20,160
Your police station had five deputy chiefs in total.

743
00:25:20,160 --> 00:25:21,620
You retired ranked fifth.

744
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:23,320
You should thank me for that.

745
00:25:23,320 --> 00:25:25,320
You went from a lowly cop to a section chief.

746
00:25:25,320 --> 00:25:27,880
Every time you got promoted, it was because you caught me.

747
00:25:27,880 --> 00:25:28,520
You've got it backwards.

748
00:25:28,520 --> 00:25:30,080
I made a huge contribution.

749
00:25:30,080 --> 00:25:31,520
Who should be thanking whom?

750
00:25:31,520 --> 00:25:33,240
If I hadn't caught you in time

751
00:25:33,240 --> 00:25:35,040
and put you on the right path,

752
00:25:35,760 --> 00:25:37,840
you would have been shot eight times over.

753
00:25:37,840 --> 00:25:39,960
Next month, Xiaolong would be burning paper money for you

754
00:25:39,960 --> 00:25:41,490
for your 14th anniversary.

755
00:25:41,520 --> 00:25:43,480
I finally know who my daughter...

756
00:25:43,760 --> 00:25:44,720
Takes after.

757
00:25:44,840 --> 00:25:47,970
You've led her astray, making her talk so mean, you know?

758
00:25:48,560 --> 00:25:49,360
Come here.

759
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:51,080
The son you think about day and night is back.

760
00:25:51,080 --> 00:25:52,540
Who's thinking about him?

761
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:56,440
Isn't this Xiaolong?

762
00:25:56,560 --> 00:25:57,760
Xiaolong is back too.

763
00:26:00,960 --> 00:26:02,420
Look, they're at it again.

764
00:26:15,840 --> 00:26:17,300
Have you been busy lately?

765
00:26:17,640 --> 00:26:18,300
Not too bad.

766
00:26:18,840 --> 00:26:20,300
Are you eating here today?

767
00:26:20,560 --> 00:26:22,080
I won't be eating here today.

768
00:26:22,080 --> 00:26:23,360
I still have a lot of cases to work on.

769
00:26:23,360 --> 00:26:25,220
But I've already thawed the meat.

770
00:26:28,440 --> 00:26:30,300
If you're never going to eat here,

771
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:31,730
don't buy so much stuff.

772
00:26:31,840 --> 00:26:33,520
Look how full the fridge is.

773
00:26:35,040 --> 00:26:36,770
I can't finish it all by myself.

774
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:44,520
Dad, if there's nothing else,

775
00:26:44,520 --> 00:26:45,320
I'll get going.

776
00:26:45,320 --> 00:26:46,780
I still have a lot of cases.

777
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:48,300
You're so busy.

778
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:50,040
What case are you working on?

779
00:26:50,960 --> 00:26:52,120
An organized crime case.

780
00:26:52,120 --> 00:26:53,120
Organized crime?

781
00:26:56,840 --> 00:26:58,520
Is it Shao Yinhai's case?

782
00:26:59,520 --> 00:27:00,400
You know about it?

783
00:27:00,400 --> 00:27:02,160
How could you take this case?

784
00:27:03,080 --> 00:27:04,610
Back then, this Shao Yinhai

785
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:07,280
occupied land for mining and carried out forced demolitions.

786
00:27:07,280 --> 00:27:08,880
He had people beaten bloody.

787
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:10,360
When I responded to the call,

788
00:27:10,360 --> 00:27:11,490
I saw with my own eyes

789
00:27:11,560 --> 00:27:12,800
a person beaten to death,

790
00:27:12,800 --> 00:27:13,720
lying right there.

791
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:15,160
He didn't beat that person.

792
00:27:15,160 --> 00:27:17,020
Of course he didn't do it himself.

793
00:27:17,080 --> 00:27:18,560
He directed it from behind the scenes.

794
00:27:18,560 --> 00:27:19,960
He instigated and organized it.

795
00:27:19,960 --> 00:27:21,600
They are an evil force.

796
00:27:22,600 --> 00:27:25,120
Legally, you need evidence to draw a conclusion.

797
00:27:25,120 --> 00:27:26,880
Could he be arrested without evidence?

798
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:27,360
Dad,

799
00:27:27,720 --> 00:27:29,480
before the court makes a judgment,

800
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:31,160
all accusations against him are just suspicions.

801
00:27:31,160 --> 00:27:32,160
Just suspicions.

802
00:27:32,200 --> 00:27:33,130
I'm warning you,

803
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:34,720
you are Li Guochen's son.

804
00:27:34,720 --> 00:27:36,240
You absolutely cannot touch this case.

805
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:37,520
This is a matter of principle.

806
00:27:37,520 --> 00:27:38,440
No, you have your principles,

807
00:27:38,440 --> 00:27:39,480
and I have mine.

808
00:27:39,920 --> 00:27:41,920
You're a police officer. Arresting people is fine.

809
00:27:41,920 --> 00:27:43,200
But I am a lawyer.

810
00:27:44,000 --> 00:27:45,840
My duty is to ensure my client

811
00:27:45,840 --> 00:27:48,280
receives a punishment that doesn't exceed the crime.

812
00:27:48,280 --> 00:27:49,280
This is my stance.

813
00:27:49,360 --> 00:27:50,680
My stance is

814
00:27:50,680 --> 00:27:53,080
that we can't help bad people get away with their crimes.

815
00:27:53,080 --> 00:27:54,880
No wonder Xiaolong ignores you.

816
00:27:55,680 --> 00:27:57,480
You should come here less often.

817
00:28:31,360 --> 00:28:32,080
Lawyer Li,

818
00:28:32,320 --> 00:28:33,850
it's been over ten minutes.

819
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:36,080
Waiting like this isn't a solution.

820
00:28:36,200 --> 00:28:37,460
Should we start first?

821
00:28:39,320 --> 00:28:40,320
Wait a bit longer.

822
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:46,200
Everyone's here.

823
00:28:46,360 --> 00:28:47,200
Lawyer Qiu,

824
00:28:47,360 --> 00:28:48,420
please have a seat.

825
00:28:53,600 --> 00:28:54,280
Come on,

826
00:28:54,680 --> 00:28:57,240
tell me about your progress these past few days.

827
00:28:57,240 --> 00:28:57,600
Lawyer Qiu.

828
00:28:57,600 --> 00:28:58,400
Wait a minute.

829
00:29:08,120 --> 00:29:09,320
Lawyer Qiu, our team

830
00:29:09,320 --> 00:29:11,000
has been discussing this case for the past few days.

831
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:12,440
From an evidentiary perspective,

832
00:29:12,440 --> 00:29:13,920
it's indeed a bit difficult to plead not guilty.

833
00:29:13,920 --> 00:29:15,000
If it wasn't difficult,

834
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:17,000
why would the client come to Honghu?

835
00:29:17,080 --> 00:29:18,480
Why would they come to me?

836
00:29:18,800 --> 00:29:20,000
Don't be afraid of difficulties.

837
00:29:20,000 --> 00:29:20,660
Difficulty

838
00:29:20,720 --> 00:29:22,240
is where the value lies.

839
00:29:23,440 --> 00:29:24,100
Lawyer Qiu.

840
00:29:24,280 --> 00:29:25,360
Take this for example,

841
00:29:25,360 --> 00:29:26,520
the crime of illegal business operations.

842
00:29:26,520 --> 00:29:27,520
Mr. Shao's company,

843
00:29:27,520 --> 00:29:30,120
without the approval of relevant departments,

844
00:29:30,120 --> 00:29:31,720
sold the mining license

845
00:29:31,720 --> 00:29:32,440
to two

846
00:29:32,440 --> 00:29:35,040
shell companies without any qualifications.

847
00:29:35,120 --> 00:29:37,240
The transfer contract and bank statements

848
00:29:37,240 --> 00:29:39,280
are right there in the file in black and white.

849
00:29:39,280 --> 00:29:40,080
Mr. Shao

850
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:41,800
subjectively

851
00:29:42,080 --> 00:29:43,960
