852
00:29:43,960 --> 00:29:45,600
and was deceived by the middleman.

853
00:29:45,600 --> 00:29:46,560
But the buyers' confessions

854
00:29:46,560 --> 00:29:48,600
have proven that Mr. Shao was fully aware,

855
00:29:48,600 --> 00:29:49,760
and the entire evidence collection process

856
00:29:49,760 --> 00:29:51,600
was completely legal and compliant.

857
00:29:51,600 --> 00:29:52,280
You guys

858
00:29:52,280 --> 00:29:53,960
