859
00:29:54,040 --> 00:29:55,920
You made a big case small.

860
00:29:56,760 --> 00:29:58,620
Turned a big case into a small one.

861
00:29:58,720 --> 00:29:59,280
Right.

862
00:30:00,120 --> 00:30:01,980
Turned a big case into a small one.

863
00:30:05,600 --> 00:30:07,600
Lawyer Qiu, we are indeed too young.

864
00:30:07,600 --> 00:30:09,720
We still need your guidance.

865
00:30:10,320 --> 00:30:11,000
Small cases.

866
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:11,800
Sorry, sorry.

867
00:30:12,600 --> 00:30:14,000
I'll learn from this too.

868
00:30:18,000 --> 00:30:19,800
Small cases depend on evidence,

869
00:30:20,280 --> 00:30:22,040
