876
00:30:33,600 --> 00:30:34,520
We need to broaden our perspective

877
00:30:34,520 --> 00:30:36,320
and look at this case from a higher vantage point.

878
00:30:36,320 --> 00:30:37,050
Understand?

879
00:30:37,280 --> 00:30:38,000
Be honest.

880
00:30:38,000 --> 00:30:38,730
Understood.

881
00:30:39,800 --> 00:30:41,260
