1015
00:34:50,000 --> 00:34:51,120
Come with me to the branch office.

1016
00:34:51,120 --> 00:34:51,780
Dong Beihu.

1017
00:34:53,480 --> 00:34:54,210
Understood.

1018
00:34:56,520 --> 00:34:57,280
Xin.

1019
