1023
00:35:04,240 --> 00:35:04,840
Dong Beihu.

1024
00:35:04,840 --> 00:35:05,520
Here.

1025
00:35:12,120 --> 00:35:13,040
Dong Beihu.

1026
00:35:13,560 --> 00:35:14,080
Here.

1027
