1039
00:35:34,480 --> 00:35:35,400
Help Xin up.

1040
00:35:38,400 --> 00:35:39,120
Dong Beihu.

1041
00:35:39,400 --> 00:35:40,000
Here.

1042
00:35:40,320 --> 00:35:42,840
Deep in the dense forests south of 45 degrees north latitude,

1043
00:35:42,840 --> 00:35:44,480
