1080
00:37:23,440 --> 00:37:24,120
I'm sorry.

1081
00:37:24,400 --> 00:37:26,240
I really want to get Huihui out.

1082
00:37:26,360 --> 00:37:27,240
But I...

1083
00:37:28,440 --> 00:37:29,900
