1091
00:37:46,800 --> 00:37:48,840
Misfortunes never come singly.

1092
00:37:54,200 --> 00:37:54,680
Sister,

1093
00:37:55,440 --> 00:37:56,040
tell me,

1094
00:37:56,440 --> 00:37:57,440
