1111
00:38:46,520 --> 00:38:47,180
Lawyer Qiu.

1112
00:38:47,440 --> 00:38:48,300
This is Xiao Li.

1113
00:38:48,520 --> 00:38:49,280
I'm certainly willing

1114
00:38:49,280 --> 00:38:50,760
