1115
00:38:50,760 --> 00:38:51,440
It's just that tomorrow,

1116
00:38:51,440 --> 00:38:53,640
I have a little work arrangement,

1117
00:38:53,960 --> 00:38:55,400
so I can't go with you.

1118
00:38:55,840 --> 00:38:56,770
But don't worry.

1119
00:38:56,800 --> 00:38:59,460
I'll definitely get everything you asked done.

1120
00:39:00,400 --> 00:39:02,000
Who is this guy?

1121
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:03,530
Why are you so polite to him?

1122
00:39:04,720 --> 00:39:06,440
A Beijing uncle.

1123
00:39:20,200 --> 00:39:23,800
Lawyer Qiu said you couldn't make it today because you were busy.

1124
00:39:26,160 --> 00:39:27,020
Chairman Shao,

1125
00:39:27,560 --> 00:39:29,080
I want to talk to you alone.

1126
00:39:32,080 --> 00:39:32,800
Go ahead.

1127
00:39:33,320 --> 00:39:35,580
A complete not-guilty defense strategy

1128
00:39:35,720 --> 00:39:36,580
