1129
00:39:37,040 --> 00:39:37,960
Reason?

1130
00:39:38,160 --> 00:39:40,560
Take the crime of picking quarrels and provoking trouble as an example.

1131
00:39:40,560 --> 00:39:41,840
In July 2015,

1132
00:39:42,040 --> 00:39:42,960
your subordinates

1133
00:39:42,960 --> 00:39:44,160
violently collected debts from Lao Zhang, a self-employed businessman,

1134
00:39:44,160 --> 00:39:45,960
multiple times.

1135
00:39:46,240 --> 00:39:48,880
There are 17 police dispatch records in the file.

1136
00:39:48,880 --> 00:39:50,000
In judicial practice,

1137
00:39:50,000 --> 00:39:51,040
three times is enough

1138
00:39:51,040 --> 00:39:52,840
to meet the standard for filing a criminal case.

1139
00:39:52,840 --> 00:39:54,000
The evidence is conclusive.

1140
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:56,240
Fighting it to the end will only backfire.

1141
00:39:56,240 --> 00:39:57,800
If you refuse to plead guilty,

1142
00:39:57,800 --> 00:39:59,920
the consequence will be angering the judge,

1143
00:39:59,920 --> 00:40:02,180
bringing the risk of a maximum sentence.

1144
00:40:02,480 --> 00:40:03,400
Then tell me,

1145
00:40:03,960 --> 00:40:05,560
how do you want to fight this?

1146
00:40:06,920 --> 00:40:07,720
Illegal business operations,

1147
00:40:07,720 --> 00:40:08,680
falsely issuing invoices,

1148
00:40:08,680 --> 00:40:09,960
and picking quarrels and provoking trouble.

1149
00:40:09,960 --> 00:40:10,960
There is no room to fight

1150
00:40:10,960 --> 00:40:12,160
these three charges.

1151
00:40:12,720 --> 00:40:14,320
I suggest pleading guilty and accepting punishment

1152
00:40:14,320 --> 00:40:16,360
to establish a good attitude of admitting guilt.

1153
00:40:16,360 --> 00:40:18,240
As for the other violent crimes,

1154
00:40:18,960 --> 00:40:20,080
we should focus on fighting them

1155
00:40:20,080 --> 00:40:21,840
and try our best to prevent them from being classified,

1156
00:40:21,840 --> 00:40:26,440
to remove the major charge of organizing and leading a mafia-style organization.

1157
00:40:27,240 --> 00:40:28,100
Lawyer Qiu said

1158
00:40:28,560 --> 00:40:29,600
that my case

1159
00:40:29,720 --> 00:40:32,040
should be viewed from a higher dimension.

1160
00:40:32,040 --> 00:40:32,800
The court

1161
00:40:32,960 --> 00:40:34,360
doesn't just look at the case.

1162
00:40:34,360 --> 00:40:35,890
It also looks at the person.

1163
00:40:36,160 --> 00:40:37,360
Are my contributions

1164
00:40:37,400 --> 00:40:38,730
to Leyang over the years

1165
00:40:38,840 --> 00:40:40,000
just written off?

1166
00:40:40,320 --> 00:40:41,180
Chairman Shao,

1167
00:40:41,480 --> 00:40:42,720
Qin Shi Huang unified the six states

1168
00:40:42,720 --> 00:40:44,120
and built the Great Wall.

1169
00:40:45,560 --> 00:40:47,290
But that doesn't mean he didn't

1170
00:40:47,520 --> 00:40:49,480
burn books and bury scholars alive.

1171
00:40:49,480 --> 00:40:50,600
Flaws do not hide virtues,

1172
00:40:50,600 --> 00:40:52,160
and merits do not cover up faults.

1173
00:40:52,160 --> 00:40:54,040
If we fight according to my strategy

1174
00:40:54,040 --> 00:40:55,520
and remove the mafia label,

1175
00:40:55,520 --> 00:40:56,200
you are just

1176
00:40:56,200 --> 00:40:58,480
a private entrepreneur who made some mistakes.

1177
00:40:58,480 --> 00:41:00,000
But if you remain stubborn

1178
00:41:00,160 --> 00:41:01,960
and still fight for a not-guilty verdict,

1179
00:41:01,960 --> 00:41:02,960
once you fail,

1180
00:41:03,520 --> 00:41:04,200
you will be

1181
00:41:04,200 --> 00:41:07,080
a mafia boss in the guise of an entrepreneur,

1182
00:41:07,240 --> 00:41:08,520
an enemy of the people.

1183
00:41:09,800 --> 00:41:11,800
What's the use of paying so much tax?

1184
00:41:12,680 --> 00:41:13,400
It's just

1185
00:41:13,920 --> 00:41:15,780
evidence of funding evil forces.

1186
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:18,880
Why should I trust you?

1187
00:41:19,960 --> 00:41:21,200
A junior lawyer

1188
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:24,490
who hasn't been in this business for long, right?

1189
00:41:24,600 --> 00:41:26,400
You have seen the world.

1190
00:41:27,360 --> 00:41:28,960
You have to see the current situation

1191
00:41:28,960 --> 00:41:30,520
clearly for yourself.

1192
00:41:55,960 --> 00:41:56,690
Lawyer Xiao.

1193
00:41:57,200 --> 00:41:57,840
I'm sorry.

1194
00:41:57,840 --> 00:41:59,600
My father-in-law is not feeling well today,

1195
00:41:59,600 --> 00:42:01,130
so he asked me to come first.

1196
00:42:03,440 --> 00:42:04,240
I understand.

1197
00:42:04,480 --> 00:42:06,400
After all, Uncle Yu trusts you so much,

1198
00:42:06,400 --> 00:42:08,200
and you care about this case the most.

1199
00:42:08,200 --> 00:42:10,060
Is there any progress on our case?

1200
00:42:10,800 --> 00:42:11,330
Alright.

1201
00:42:15,640 --> 00:42:16,960
Speaking of progress,

1202
00:42:17,360 --> 00:42:19,480
things are indeed a bit troublesome.

1203
00:42:22,680 --> 00:42:24,680
It's all my fault for being useless.

1204
00:42:25,040 --> 00:42:26,640
I can't even save my own wife.

1205
00:42:27,400 --> 00:42:28,680
I'm just a loser.

1206
00:42:30,320 --> 00:42:32,180
It seems I can only accept my fate.

1207
00:42:32,240 --> 00:42:34,040
You can't just accept your fate.

1208
00:42:34,360 --> 00:42:35,880
Yu Huihui is my client.

1209
00:42:36,320 --> 00:42:37,980
She might not accept her fate.

1210
00:42:38,680 --> 00:42:39,520
Lawyer Xiao.

1211
00:42:39,960 --> 00:42:42,320
You don't need to feel too much pressure about this.

1212
00:42:42,320 --> 00:42:43,780
I don't feel any pressure.

1213
00:42:43,880 --> 00:42:45,400
But why do I feel like

1214
00:42:47,400 --> 00:42:49,560
you don't really want her to get out?
